{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/10061f68de9160ca7473b0aaa8a356d0.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Apocalypse is a survival sandbox built around one idea: to simulate what it means to survive in a world taken over by aliens. <br>No one knows exactly how it started, only that the world has changed beyond recognition. <br>Civilization has collapsed, and humanity is no longer in control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the few survivors struggle to endure, not just against hunger, cold, and fear, but against something far more powerful that now rules the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Apocalypse is an open-world sandbox survival game set in the aftermath of this unexpected event.<br>Adapt, build, explore, and turn alien technology into your last hope for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/abf4532187f87961c228f3785d8ff5ad.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/abf4532187f87961c228f3785d8ff5ad.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/abf4532187f87961c228f3785d8ff5ad.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/d1b97ddb04691c8ff49e0d39c3e7886f.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has become unpredictable, harsh, and hostile.<br>You\u2019ll need to scavenge for food, craft tools, and fortify shelters to withstand constant threats.<br>Hunger, thirst, and exhaustion are as deadly as any creature you\u2019ll face.<br>There are no heroes here, only survivors trying to make it one more day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/0f1ddfba5544e03b90450dc74d060ad3.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/0f1ddfba5544e03b90450dc74d060ad3.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/0f1ddfba5544e03b90450dc74d060ad3.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/ac49eca329d618c1cd3f2a0e3dcd5ac4.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet is overrun by lifeforms and technology no one fully understands.<br>Collect alien technology, study it, and learn to reverse-engineer it.<br>Turn the invaders\u2019 own weapons against them, or build hybrid tools that fuse human and alien engineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/b69ae0b10d58abe43f911effc5401a3e.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/b69ae0b10d58abe43f911effc5401a3e.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/b69ae0b10d58abe43f911effc5401a3e.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/d3e725a1fabb0f54ae17659f5dd7ba9d.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you face the apocalypse alone or with friends, survival demands preparation.<br>Play solo for a tense, personal challenge, or team up in online co-op to share supplies, build together, and defend your base from alien incursions.<br>Every alliance comes with risk, and trust can be as fragile as the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/bcd9055087e0a708754771339a64679f.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/bcd9055087e0a708754771339a64679f.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/bcd9055087e0a708754771339a64679f.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/370d0b14f83911c477ced8bc4e2d8c96.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Alien Apocalypse was built to be explored.<br>From crumbling city blocks to desolate countryside, danger and opportunity are everywhere.<br>Climb, jump, and move with freedom to  escape danger and discover hidden paths.<br>Every building could be a shelter\u2026 or a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/4d390cf7ee7fd5bebe543596561391aa.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/4d390cf7ee7fd5bebe543596561391aa.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/4d390cf7ee7fd5bebe543596561391aa.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/476894145f9f4acc9e23a0f490c1158e.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures that now roam the planet are not mindless beasts.<br>They think, learn, and change.<br>Each encounter is different, and the deeper you explore, the more unpredictable they become.<br>The longer you survive, the more the world itself seems to turn against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/a0af910c67d04aa6ae8be7cedc9a6085.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/a0af910c67d04aa6ae8be7cedc9a6085.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/a0af910c67d04aa6ae8be7cedc9a6085.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/b6ad8420d7fd5eb8d97a93248ca79252.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a game about saving the world.<br>It\u2019s about discovering what\u2019s left of it and surviving one more day.<br>Create your survivor, shape your path, and make your own story in a world that no longer belongs to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/3cc3a25b9868f7ff6c627b6890275cec.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/3cc3a25b9868f7ff6c627b6890275cec.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/3cc3a25b9868f7ff6c627b6890275cec.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635510?t=1770929366","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/c2b37fde1bd0cd87af1e35f07daa622cb0bc09ef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770929366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/c2abca04388637dbaaceda30fc49a1df4e3e8b26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770929366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/c2abca04388637dbaaceda30fc49a1df4e3e8b26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770929366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/4729d65aaed58624c856901dfd38c1fb.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=600 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/4729d65aaed58624c856901dfd38c1fb.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/10061f68de9160ca7473b0aaa8a356d0.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Apocalypse is a survival sandbox built around one idea: to simulate what it means to survive in a world taken over by aliens. <br>No one knows exactly how it started, only that the world has changed beyond recognition. <br>Civilization has collapsed, and humanity is no longer in control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the few survivors struggle to endure, not just against hunger, cold, and fear, but against something far more powerful that now rules the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Apocalypse is an open-world sandbox survival game set in the aftermath of this unexpected event.<br>Adapt, build, explore, and turn alien technology into your last hope for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/abf4532187f87961c228f3785d8ff5ad.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/abf4532187f87961c228f3785d8ff5ad.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/abf4532187f87961c228f3785d8ff5ad.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/d1b97ddb04691c8ff49e0d39c3e7886f.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has become unpredictable, harsh, and hostile.<br>You\u2019ll need to scavenge for food, craft tools, and fortify shelters to withstand constant threats.<br>Hunger, thirst, and exhaustion are as deadly as any creature you\u2019ll face.<br>There are no heroes here, only survivors trying to make it one more day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/0f1ddfba5544e03b90450dc74d060ad3.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/0f1ddfba5544e03b90450dc74d060ad3.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/0f1ddfba5544e03b90450dc74d060ad3.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/ac49eca329d618c1cd3f2a0e3dcd5ac4.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet is overrun by lifeforms and technology no one fully understands.<br>Collect alien technology, study it, and learn to reverse-engineer it.<br>Turn the invaders\u2019 own weapons against them, or build hybrid tools that fuse human and alien engineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/b69ae0b10d58abe43f911effc5401a3e.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/b69ae0b10d58abe43f911effc5401a3e.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/b69ae0b10d58abe43f911effc5401a3e.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/d3e725a1fabb0f54ae17659f5dd7ba9d.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you face the apocalypse alone or with friends, survival demands preparation.<br>Play solo for a tense, personal challenge, or team up in online co-op to share supplies, build together, and defend your base from alien incursions.<br>Every alliance comes with risk, and trust can be as fragile as the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/bcd9055087e0a708754771339a64679f.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/bcd9055087e0a708754771339a64679f.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/bcd9055087e0a708754771339a64679f.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/370d0b14f83911c477ced8bc4e2d8c96.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Alien Apocalypse was built to be explored.<br>From crumbling city blocks to desolate countryside, danger and opportunity are everywhere.<br>Climb, jump, and move with freedom to  escape danger and discover hidden paths.<br>Every building could be a shelter\u2026 or a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/4d390cf7ee7fd5bebe543596561391aa.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/4d390cf7ee7fd5bebe543596561391aa.webm?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/4d390cf7ee7fd5bebe543596561391aa.mp4?t=1770929366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/476894145f9f4acc9e23a0f490c1158e.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1560 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures that now roam the planet are not mindless beasts.<br>They think, learn, and change.<br>Each encounter is different, and the deeper you explore, the more unpredictable they become.<br>The longer you survive, the more the world itself seems to turn against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/a0af910c67d04aa6ae8be7cedc9a6085.poster.avif?t=1770929366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/ext